SUMMARY:College of Youth Leadership 26 (CYL)
LOCATION:Mount Hood Community College\, Gresham\, Oregon
DESCRIPTION:Cascade Pacific Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/492-
 2026cyl\n\nCommissioner / University of Scouting\n\nNovember 7\, 2026\n7:
 30AM to 4:30PM\nLeadership: CYL Under the Sea\nThe College of Youth Leade
 rship (CYL) is youth-led leadership training developed and presented by t
 he Wauna La-Mon’tay Lodge. CYL is open to all registered Troop-aged Sco
 uts who want to enhance their leadership skills\, share ideas\, and enjoy
  a day of fellowship with other Scouts from around the council. The cours
 es are taught by lodge members in two tracks\,\nIntroductory and Advanced
 \n\, using games and interactive presentations.\nIntro
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/492-2026cyl
