SUMMARY:RATA Training - NRA Range Safety Officer Course (RSO)
LOCATION:Cascade Pacific Council\, BEAVERTON\, Oregon
DESCRIPTION:Cascade Pacific Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/492-
 121734\n\nRange Officer / Shooting Instructor\n\nRange Safety Officer Tra
 ining\nRSO’s are an essential element of the required supervision for s
 hooting ranges from the unit level to the council level.\nAbout\nNRA RSO 
 is a basic level course and Basic Instructor Training is not required. Th
 is course will allow the participant an opportunity to attain the RSO cer
 tification. The course starts at 8am promptly and you must attend the en
 tire course to be certified.\nThis is an NRA course\nand registration mus
 t be done on the\nNRA Training Course Website\na
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/492-121734
END:VEVENT
