SUMMARY:OA - Wauna Inductions and Ceremonies Conference (WICC)
LOCATION:Camp Meriwether\, Cloverdale\, Oregon
DESCRIPTION:Cascade Pacific Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/492-
 112006\n\n\n\nThe induction experience is one of the most important servi
 ces the Order of the Arrow does for Scouting. Attending WICC will provide
  training for those that want to create an incredible Induction for our n
 ewest members. Ceremonialist\, Elangomats\, Induction staff and Advisers 
 should attend this valuable weekend experience.\nWhen & Where\nSave the D
 ate\nCamp Meriwether\nFriday 01-22-2027 6:00 PM PT to\nSunday 01-24-2027 
 11:00 AM PT\nMore Information\nMap of Event\nCoords: 45.318604355980874\,
  -123.96150831
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/492-112006
